Output media/viewer.gif
Set Width 1000
Set Height 480
Set FontSize 18
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell "bash --noprofile --norc"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Hide
Type "\"$RATATUI_DIFF_VIEWER\""
Enter
Wait+Screen /quit/
Show
Sleep 500ms
Screenshot media/viewer.png
Type "s"
Sleep 500ms
Type "t"
Sleep 500ms
Type "m"
Sleep 500ms
Hide
Type "q"
